            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Tram Anh",
            "review_text": "mshammie\nSingapore371 contributions\n0\nSurprisingly good chicken rice\nAug 2015 • Couples\nI pointed to the chicken drumstick grilling at the back, and was given a plate of yellow rice, sliced cucumber and carrot and the heavenly fragrant drumstick. And a dollop of mystery sauce. Thickened chicken fats? Whatever it is, it grew on me and I wish there was more.\nBack to the chicken - it's pretty much one of the top ten grilled foodstuffs that I've eaten in Nha Trang, no easy feat considering the proliferation of BBQ restaurants in town. Smoky, tender, flavourful. Perfect!\nComplimentary chilled tea water is also available.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 13, 2015",
